# Workbooks Blog

facet app

Our thesis — why the workbook is the unit of software, why isolation should come for free, why your
secrets should never touch the OS. Migrated from the old `web/blog` HTML into a `.work` workbook: each
post is a prose page, the nexus renders the site (sidebar + clean URLs), the brand lives in
`design.work`. Reusing the evergreen positioning; nothing here was throwaway news.

app :blog do
  title "Workbooks Blog"

  section "Posts" do
    page "posts/the-wall-is-coming-down"
    page "posts/your-secrets-never-touch-the-os"
    page "posts/software-you-can-hold"
  end
end
